/01954 - Volodymyr Bakotskyi - Letter Of Engagement and CV","tag":"Curiculum Vitae","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-10","description":"Kindly submit a curriculum vitae and an engagement letter for the position of compliance officer.","notes":null},{"title":"Compliance Officer","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-12","description":"Curacao regulations authorise a CO to hold not more than 10 CO roles. CO surpasses limit. Appoint an alternate CO, fluent in AML and submit their PHDF and required documents","notes":null},{"title":"Local Director","tag":"Director's List","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-12","description":"Frank H.C Lammers indicated role as corporate trustee. Clarify this role/in which entity the role is held. Update/remove if necessary He also indicates role as Non-executive director - At least one local executive director is required. Update role to executive","notes":null},{"title":"Financial Statements","tag":"Financial Audit","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-12","description":"FS 2022 submitted are unsigned. Resubmit signed by director. Submit FS 2023 and financials in whatever form, yet signed by director, which must not be older than 6 months","notes":null},{"title":"Corporate Structure","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-12","description":"Corporate structure is unsigned. The financials also make reference to 'group' company/subsidiary 'Borse Platform Ltd'. If still applicable, include entire group in corporate structure and resubmit signed by director","notes":null},{"title":"Share Ledger Certification","tag":"Share Ledger","criticality":"High","due":"2025-03-12","description":"Share ledger is uncertified. Resubmit certified (View PHDF for certification guidance if needed)","notes":null},{"title":"Source of Funds of Business","tag":"Source of Funds","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-12","description":"Submit enhanced documentation as to how the operations of the applicant company are funded and by whom, including certified documentation which shows funds owned by the company through cash flow or other means.","notes":null},{"title":"Business Plan","tag":"Business Plan","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-12","description":"The Business Plan lacks information and criteria listed in the guidelines on the application portal. It does not include a management structure, allocated responsibilities, controls, provision of information about payment gateways, contractual and financial model with key suppliers. It also does not provide a detailed 3 year broken down financial forecast. Kindly review the guidelines on the portal, revise the business plan and resubmit.","notes":null},{"title":"Business and Corporate Information Form","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-12","description":"The company does not appear to be a start up and appears to have existed under a Master License. Clarify response to question 7. Update answer accordingly and resubmit form .","notes":null},{"title":"AML Policy","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-12","description":"The AML policy must adhere to Curacao AML laws. Kindly amend.","notes":null},{"title":"Prohibited Jurisdictions","tag":"Prohibiited Countries","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-12","description":"Although the site blocks access from the Netherlands and the T&Cs contain an adequate prohibited jurisdictions list, players are still allowed to choose the Netherlands as their country of residence at registration stage. Players residing in Curacao, the Netherlands, USA, UN sanctioned countries and FATF blacklisted countries must not be allowed to register an account. Kindly amend.","notes":null},{"title":"Player Registration","tag":"Player Registration","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-12","description":"The registration form does not require the player's name, address or DOB. This information must be collected at the latest prior to